      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "84ab847b-1bad-5351-8718-5cf62bff28a4",
      "content": "주말 경기 상대가 만만치 않다는 평이 많습니다.\n솔직히 이길 자신 있으십니까?",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Many say this weekend's opponent is a tough one.\nHonestly, are you confident you can win?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c7ed926b-fd99-5785-86a5-e69464bf4350",
